    "主机密钥未受信任或已变更，Harbor 未发送密码。请先在“终端”中使用交互式 ssh 连接，核对并接受主机指纹后再重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The host key is not trusted or has changed, so Harbor did not send the password. First connect with interactive ssh in Terminal, verify and accept the fingerprint, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机密钥未受信任或已变更，Harbor 未发送密码。请先在“终端”中使用交互式 ssh 连接，核对并接受主机指纹后再重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主机无效：“%@”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid host: “%@”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机无效：“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主机：%@:%lld\nHarbor 将严格验证 RDP 证书；证书不受信任或与主机名不匹配时会被拒绝，不会自动忽略自签名证书。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host: %1$@:%2$lld\nHarbor strictly validates the RDP certificate. An untrusted certificate or hostname mismatch will be rejected; self-signed certificates are not ignored automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机：%@:%lld\nHarbor 将严格验证 RDP 证书；证书不受信任或与主机名不匹配时会被拒绝，不会自动忽略自签名证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
