    "公钥已安装，但无法验证密钥登录。请先解锁私钥并加入 ssh-agent；如服务器未开启公钥认证，请联系管理员处理。Harbor 不会修改 sshd_config。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The public key was installed, but key-based login could not be verified. Unlock the private key and add it to ssh-agent. If public-key authentication is disabled on the server, contact its administrator. Harbor will not modify sshd_config."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公钥已安装，但无法验证密钥登录。请先解锁私钥并加入 ssh-agent；如服务器未开启公钥认证，请联系管理员处理。Harbor 不会修改 sshd_config。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公钥已安装，但服务器仍要求密码（可能未开启公钥认证，且当前用户无权修改）。请让管理员设置 PubkeyAuthentication yes。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The public key was installed, but the server still requires a password (public-key authentication may be disabled, and the current user cannot change it). Ask your administrator to set PubkeyAuthentication yes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公钥已安装，但服务器仍要求密码（可能未开启公钥认证，且当前用户无权修改）。请让管理员设置 PubkeyAuthentication yes。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
