          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步内容：主机（地址、用户名、端口、密钥路径、隧道规则）、文件夹、快捷命令、脚本、工作区。私钥本体、密码、TOTP 密钥、命令历史、会话录制与 IP 归属地缓存不会同步。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synced: hosts (address, username, port, key paths, tunnel rules), folders, quick commands, scripts, workspaces. Never synced: private keys, passwords, TOTP secrets, command history, session recordings, and GeoIP caches."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步内容：主机（地址、用户名、端口、密钥路径、隧道规则）、文件夹、快捷命令、脚本、工作区。私钥本体、密码、TOTP 密钥、命令历史、会话录制与 IP 归属地缓存不会同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步文件无法解析，已暂停同步以免覆盖数据。文件：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sync file could not be parsed; sync paused to avoid overwriting data. File: %@"
