    "将删除同步目录中的 sync-envelope.json。本机数据不受影响；同步保持开启时，下次本地变更会重建该文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes sync-envelope.json from the sync folder. Local data is not affected; while sync stays enabled, the next local change recreates the file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除同步目录中的 sync-envelope.json。本机数据不受影响；同步保持开启时，下次本地变更会重建该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将绕过回收站，直接在服务器上执行 rm -rf 永久删除以下 %lld 个项目，不可恢复：\n%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This bypasses the trash and runs rm -rf on the server, permanently deleting the following %lld item(s) — this cannot be undone:\n%@"
