    "开启后会向第三方服务查询主机 IP 的国家/城市，主机地址会发给该服务。内网地址仅本地识别，不发起网络请求。默认关闭。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, host IPs are sent to a third-party service to look up their country/city. Private addresses are recognized locally and never queried. Off by default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后会向第三方服务查询主机 IP 的国家/城市，主机地址会发给该服务。内网地址仅本地识别，不发起网络请求。默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，上传 / 下载文件夹会先打包成单个 tar.gz 再传输，大量小文件会快很多；关闭则逐个文件传输。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, uploading / downloading a folder packs it into a single tar.gz first — far faster for many small files; when off, files transfer one by one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，上传 / 下载文件夹会先打包成单个 tar.gz 再传输，大量小文件会快很多；关闭则逐个文件传输。"
          }
        }
      }
