    "默认关闭。关闭时历史只保留在当前运行内，并会清除 UserDefaults 中已有的命令和远程路径。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. When disabled, history remains only for the current run and existing command and remote path history is removed from UserDefaults."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。关闭时历史只保留在当前运行内，并会清除 UserDefaults 中已有的命令和远程路径。"
          }
        }
      }
